                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>• Overall campaign conversion rate is 11.27%, with 4,640 successful conversions from 41,188 contacts.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>• Cellular contact shows a higher conversion rate (14.74%) than telephone (5.23%).</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>• Conversion rates vary across months, with some months showing substantially higher performance.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>• Conversion performance differs across job and education segments.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='9'>• Student customers show the highest conversion rate among job segments (31.43%), followed by retired customers (25.23%).</run>
